{
  "Q01": [
    {
      "path": "AGENTS.md",
      "locator": "L21-21",
      "text": "| Runtime ownership, engine posture, JSON-RPC, vocabulary, identifiers, persisted event shapes | [Project contract details](docs/architecture/PROJECT_CONTRACT_DETAILS.md) and the owning domain manifest |",
      "sha256": "4262f03c7ebb047e6d073ffcb1feb8f2370abcf8ef163d8da76799b298cdf296"
    },
    {
      "path": "AGENTS.md",
      "locator": "L34-34",
      "text": "- Electron and Python communicate through JSON-RPC over stdio. `sidecar/protocol.py` owns wire constants and allowed methods; `scripts/checks/check_protocol_contract.py` enforces the vocabulary. Read the detailed contract before changing a protocol, identifier, tool ID, persisted event kind, or boundary casing.",
      "sha256": "4262f03c7ebb047e6d073ffcb1feb8f2370abcf8ef163d8da76799b298cdf296"
    }
  ],
  "Q02": [
    {
